cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this framework, please cite it. Cite the version DOI to fix a
  specific calculation, the concept DOI for the framework as a whole, and the
  arXiv identifier for the text. A headline figure should always travel with
  its plausibility band and its confidence label.
title: "InferenceCarbon: A Bounded Estimation Framework for the Per-Token Carbon Intensity of LLM Inference Under Limited Disclosure"
